  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural Heritage as a Driver for Economic Revival of Janjev&#xbf;/Janjevo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the action is to rehabilitate the historic center of Janjev&#xeb;/Janjevo, as a driver for supporting cultural tourism by improving primary infrastructure followed by the improvement of public spaces and living environment through conservation of selected buildings, as well as promotion of tourism-based economy.</narrative>
  </description>
